      {
        "dialogue_id": "beat-2",
        "beat_id": "beat-2",
        "scene_id": "scene-01",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "Why does that matter right now? the key metric is redshift. As light travels through expanding space, its wavelength stretches, shifting toward the.",
