        "beat_id": "beat-3",
        "scene_id": "scene-02",
        "speaker": "Narrator",
        "text": "From that wavelength, watch what this changes next — surveys like DESI map millions of these shifts. The data shows distant galaxies are.",
        "emotion": "",
